{
    "about": "The root names of the site (documentation/Canonical Form.md, section \"The root names of the site\"). Both implementations read every case: `reserved` gives a name and whether it is a reserved root name, `folded` gives two texts and whether they have one folded form, `obsidian` gives a vault path and the path that Obsidian gives it (its `normalizePath`, section \"Paths\"), `twins` gives paths and, for each path whose Obsidian path is the Obsidian path of another one, the first such other path in the order of the code points.",
